Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:33:18 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [skyrl-train] Run the FSDP2 trainer on Cloud TPU through
 TorchTPU

Add an accelerator module selected by SKYRL_DEVICE (cuda by default, behavior
unchanged) and route the FSDP workers' device calls through it; add a `reload`
weight-sync backend for external servers; decode render kwargs_data without
vLLM; vendor flash-attn's padding helpers; validate the `reload` config.

Refs #2553

Signed-off-by: debjyotictr <debjyotictr@holbox.ai>
