Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:38:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] [skyrl-train] Address review: TPU worker startup and
 reload sync robustness

- Ray workers always get TORCH_DEVICE_BACKEND_AUTOLOAD=0 on TPU; each rank's
  chip and topology env is applied before TorchTPU loads.
- reload: per-job export directory that removes only its own exports; tokenizer
  and processor files copied into each export; no initial-sync skip after a
  checkpoint restore; non-zero ranks wait on a CPU group whose timeout covers
  the reload; the sync runs off the worker event loop; no /pause and /resume
  around a reload; IPv6 agent URLs; clear errors for unreachable agents.
- getattr for torch._C._get_privateuse1_backend_name and torch.accelerator.
- Tests for the above.

Signed-off-by: debjyotictr <debjyotictr@holbox.ai>
